  "description": "Operating Area: Bahamas, United States - Florida East Coast\n\nExperience Luxury and Adventure on the 92’ LOA Symbol  Yacht, M/Y Andiamo\nDiscover unparalleled luxury and adventure aboard the 92’\nLOA Symbol yacht, Andiamo. Designed for both entertaining and tranquil relaxation, this stunning yacht offers breathtaking adventures and endless opportunities for fun and exploration.\nContact us today to start planning your custom-tailored experience.\n\nWhy Andiamo?\nYour Perfect Adventure Yacht \nAndiamo, meaning \"Let's Go!\" in Italian, invites you to embark on unforgettable journeys. Whether you’re snorkeling with the family in the Bahamas/Florida Keys, fishing for the big catch, or touring the Florida golf scene on a corporate event; Andiamo is your ultimate adventure yacht.\n\nEnjoy a day filled with water activities using our extensive collection of water toys, including a 16’ 8-person Highfield tender, a 3-person highspeed Waverunner, two paddle boards, a wakeboard & water skis for kids and adults, and snorkel gear for ten. Capture every moment with a GoPro, perfect for filming both above and below the water.\n\nUnique Features for Enhanced Exploration\nOne of Andiamo’s standout features is its 4.5ft draft (depth below the water), allowing us to navigate shallow waters with ease. This unique build lets us access the best shallow and well-protected areas, ideal for snorkeling and jumping off the boat into crystal-clear waters. Experience secluded areas to anchor and hidden beaches that other yachts can’t reach. \n\nDiscover the Heart of Andiamo\nThe true essence of Andiamo lies within its expansive aft and lower decks, the ultimate hub for relaxation and entertainment. Here, guests can immerse themselves in all that Andiamo has to offer, creating unforgettable memories in a shared space. Sip a refreshing cocktail on the aft deck while watching the kids leap into the water or enjoy thrilling rides on the jet ski and \ntender.",
